# Production Rules

The project must become production-ready.

Mandatory:
- Remove dead code
- Remove unused imports
- Optimize performance
- Add loading states
- Add retry systems
- Add logs
- Add analytics hooks
- Add crash prevention
- Add API timeout handling
- Add connection recovery
- Optimize map rendering
- Prevent memory leaks

Everything must feel stable and professional.
